  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KE</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mn>500</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;.....(i)</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>KE</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;.....(ii)</p><p>From equation (i) and (ii)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mn>500</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p>Put the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>hc</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1237</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>61</mn><mi>eV</mi></math></p>"
